      "biography": "<p><em>Conductors Throne (Kashu, Harmonic Branch).</em> Your Doki act as a bonus action on your turn. They use your proficiency bonus and your highest jutsu attack bonus or save DC.</p><p><strong>Large Mutant.</strong> <strong>Armor Class</strong> 16 + 3 at 7th and 15th levels · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 20 + (Three times your level) · <strong>Speed</strong> 30 ft. STR +4, DEX +3, CON +5, INT −2, WIS +0, CHA +0. <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> All Mental, Exhaustion. <strong>Saving Throws</strong> Str, Con. <strong>Skills</strong> Athletics (Mastery 2), Acrobatics, Perception. <strong>Senses</strong> Blindsight 30 ft.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> hit points, proficiency bonus, highest jutsu attack bonus and save DC, and your level. Add the AC increases at 7th and 15th by hand.</p>"
